                      <h3 style={{fontFamily:"monospace",fontSize:"11px",color:"rgba(59,130,246,0.95)",fontWeight:600,letterSpacing:"1.5px",marginBottom:"10px",textTransform:"uppercase"}}>1. BETTER OPPORTUNITY</h3>
